<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 28pt;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sub-heading {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .body-text {
    font-size: 10pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .contact-info {
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 50px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: #555;
  }
  .image-container {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 class="header-title">Contact us</h2>
      <div class="contact-info" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p>ABB Inc.</p>
        <p>Low Voltage Products</p>
        <p>123 Main Street</p>
        <p>{{ contact_address }}</p>
        <p>Phone: {{ contact_phone }}</p>
        <p>Email: {{ contact_email }}</p>
        <p>Web: <a href="{{ contact_website }}">{{ contact_website }}</a></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">© Copyright {{ current_year }} ABB Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 55%; text-align: center;">
      <div class="image-container">
        <img src="{{ image_path_1 }}" alt="Industrial machinery" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h1 class="header-title">Machine safeguarding solutions for the material handling industries</h1>
      <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <p>Understanding complete machine safety systems</p>
        <p>Many of today's material handling facilities often struggle to see the full picture of machine safety. The complexity of modern machinery, together with evolving safety standards, requires a holistic approach. ABB provides comprehensive machine safety solutions that are properly designed and executed to increase productivity and profitability. Our solutions are designed to meet the most stringent safety requirements, ensuring compliance and operational excellence. We help you achieve the highest level of safety while maximizing efficiency.</p>
        <p>The idea that safety devices are the same and can be used in any application is a misconception. Machine safety is a complex discipline that requires a tailored approach. ABB's expertise allows us to design and implement solutions that are perfectly suited to your specific operational needs, ensuring maximum protection without hindering productivity.</p>
        <p>Machine Safety - Productivity - Profitability</p>
        <p>Productivity and machine safety are not contradictory terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <h3 class="section-heading">Challenge and Commitment</h3>
        <p>The need for machine safety has become one of the most critical aspects of modern industrial operations. Safety is not just a regulatory requirement; it is a fundamental commitment to protecting human life and ensuring operational continuity. ABB is committed to providing robust, reliable, and intelligent safety solutions that meet and exceed the highest industry standards.</p>
        <p>In an industry where the demands on repeatability, system uptime, and throughput are constantly increasing, the risk of accidents can be significant. ABB's solutions are engineered to mitigate these risks proactively, allowing your operations to run safely and efficiently.</p>
        <h3 class="section-heading">Decades of machine safety systems expertise</h3>
        <p>ABB brings decades of experience in designing and implementing sophisticated machine safety systems. Our global presence and deep industry knowledge allow us to tailor solutions that fit the unique challenges of your material handling environment, from warehousing to manufacturing.</p>
        <h3 class="section-heading">Overcoming industry issues</h3>
        <p>Material handling systems require a high sustainability level to ensure both worker safety and operational longevity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <h3 class="section-heading">Our Value Commitment</h3>
        <p>ABB is working to help material handling facilities and manufacturers meet demanding production and delivery schedules while maintaining the highest safety standards. We provide comprehensive machine safety solutions that integrate seamlessly with your existing infrastructure, ensuring compliance and operational excellence.</p>
        <p>We are committed to helping you meet the unique safety challenges of your operation, providing solutions that enhance productivity and profitability.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <h3 class="section-heading">Understanding complete machine safety systems</h3>
        <p>ABB knows that machine safety solutions that are properly designed and executed will increase productivity and profitability. Our solutions are designed to meet the most stringent safety requirements, ensuring compliance and operational excellence. We help you achieve the highest level of safety while maximizing efficiency.</p>
        <p>The idea that safety devices are the same and can be used in any application is a misconception. Machine safety is a complex discipline that requires a tailored approach. ABB's expertise allows us to design and implement solutions that are perfectly suited to your specific operational needs, ensuring maximum protection without hindering productivity.</p>
