        <img src="{{ image_path_2 }}" alt="Automated material handling system" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Corrosion / harsh environment and liquid handling</h3>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>Corrosion is the enemy of electrical systems coats of improper selection including replacement valve, plus labour and downtime.</p>
        <p>Common agents such as acidic fluids, corrosive materials, and high humidity can degrade electrical components, leading to premature failure and costly downtime. ABB offers products in aluminum, stainless steel, non-metallic, PVC, and PVDF materials as a solution to your corrosion challenges.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Continuous operation and sustainability</h3>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>The costs associated with downtime in a material handling facility can be very high. If power is lost during sorting, scheduling or production, the resulting losses can be substantial. ABB offers you the following solutions:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><span data-field="continuous_operation.solution_1">{{ continuous_operation.solution_1 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="continuous_operation.solution_2">{{ continuous_operation.solution_2 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="continuous_operation.solution_3">{{ continuous_operation.solution_3 }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Due to the high cost of downtime, most material handling facilities are looking for ways to minimize interruptions. ABB offers solutions to help you achieve maximum uptime and operational efficiency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 40%;">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Safety system zoning and monitoring</h3>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>Flexible automation and timely process changes allow the Material Handling & Logistics market to continue to grow and evolve. ABB provides solutions to help you manage these changes safely and efficiently. ABB offers you the following solutions:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><span data-field="safety_system.solution_1">{{ safety_system.solution_1 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="safety_system.solution_2">{{ safety_system.solution_2 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="safety_system.solution_3">{{ safety_system.solution_3 }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Safety zoning and monitoring modules allow for stack integration, enabling a more intelligent and responsive safety system. This allows for a more integrated and safer operational environment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <h3 class="section-heading">Global perspective and support</h3>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>To compete in this challenging market, a global approach must be taken. ABB provides a global network of experts and resources to support your operations. ABB offers you the following solutions:</p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><span data-field="global_support.solution_1">{{ global_support.solution_1 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="global_support.solution_2">{{ global_support.solution_2 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="global_support.solution_3">{{ global_support.solution_3 }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>ABB's commitment to global standards and local expertise ensures that your safety solutions are robust, reliable, and supported wherever you operate.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 70%;">
      <div class="image-container">
        <img src="{{ image_path_3 }}" alt="Safety system components" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

